    (B) Transmembrane electric potential and (C) charge density at the membrane. Analytical solutions (solid lines) obtained by the point charge approximation are compared with FEM simulations (dashed lines) at three time points. Physiological values are considered for the calculations: ${\bar{\Gamma}\!=\!20}$, ${\bar{\delta}^{\rm M}\!=\!4}$, ${\bar{j}^{\rm o}_0\!=\!4}$, and ${\bar{R}^{\rm P}\!=\!0.1}$.
