  \theta_2 \to  \pi^- \end{array}
  } }    \int_{0}^\rho \int_{\theta_1}^{\theta_2}         \frac{ r^{n+m+ 2-\alpha }  e^{ i\theta ( m +1 -n - \alpha)} }{    e_{k-1} (  r^{\alpha} e^{ i \theta \alpha})    }     dr d\theta
