\begin{proof}
From direct computations we see that  
\begin{align*}  & |(1-\sigma)  f (z)   +   \sigma \frac{f '(z) }{ \alpha z^{\alpha-1} e_{k-1}(z^\alpha)} |^2 \\
    =   &    (1-\sigma)^2  \sum_{n,m=0}^\infty    a_n \bar a_m      z^n   {(\bar z)}^m     
