\subsection{National ASFR Trends over Years}\label{sec:national}



To illustrate some aspects of the Madagascar data, we examine national trends. Figure 
\ref{fig:natl-yearly-ASFR-UR} presents national-level estimates of ASFR over time, disaggregated by urban and rural populations. These estimates are obtained using two methods:~the direct estimation approach just described in Section \ref{sec:fert-direct-est-method} and the unit-level small area model (with covariates) which we will describe  in Section \ref{sec:fert-unit-level-model}. The latter is implemented at the Admin-1 level and aggregated based on age-group-specific population.


