The diffusion in natural scale $Y_t$ is bounded between $0$ and $p_\infty$ and is non-explosive. 
Since the map $q(y) \to \infty$ as $y\to p_\infty$, the process $v_t$ in \eqref{vsde} explodes at the first hitting time of $Y_t$ to level $p_\infty$.

