$Y = \left([0.5, 0.7, -0.8] + A[-0.4, -0.9, 0.7]\right)\begin{bmatrix}
    1\\U\\U^2
\end{bmatrix} + \varepsilon_Y$ with $\varepsilon_Y\sim\mathcal{N}(0,0.1)$.

