\end{bmatrix},$

$diag(\Psi)=[0.548, 0.632, 0.447, 0.632, 0.548, 0.447]$,

$b=[0.833, -0.078]$ and $c=0$. Finally,

$Y=([0.7, -0.5, -0.8]+A[0.5, 0.7, 0.2])\begin{bmatrix}
