Since the EGF for $\textsc{Seq}\big{(}(m_4-3) \,\, \oneincirc \,\big{)}$ is $\frac{1}{1 - (m_4 - 3)t}$, the EGF for the core and the paths of known $4$-columns leading to it is $N_6\big{(}\frac{t}{(1-(m_4-3)t)^3}\big{)}$.
