The first experiment shows tracer particles in an open wet clutch, which is a gap flow between a rotating disk and a stationary wall. A total of 30 images, like the one in Fig.\,\ref{fig:Chap6_Validation_Images-1}, containing 772 PIs were manually labeled (tracer size $d_\mathrm{P}=9.84\,$\textmu m, PI diameter $d_\mathrm{PI}=[15,31]\,$px). More details on the experiment can be found in Leister\,\textit{et al.}\,\cite{Leister.2021}.  
