The third experiment shows a column of air bubbles (bubble size $d_\mathrm{P}=[20,250]\,$\textmu m, PI diameter $d_\mathrm{PI}=[110,122]\,$px) in an otherwise stationary fluid (water). A total of 40 images, like the one in Fig.\,\ref{fig:Chap6_Validation_Images-3}, containing 201 PIs were labeled manually. More details on the experiment can be found in Sax\,\textit{et al.}\,\cite{Sax2023d}.
