    \caption{The approximation of the TCA by the quadrature-like method for $N_\mathrm{P}=60$. The discretized simulations are shown for different grid resolutions $N_\mathrm{px}=\{200,300,400\}$. It can be seen that almost no difference between the $N_\mathrm{px}=300$ and $N_\mathrm{px}=400$ resolution can be observed.}
